+         P:Val)
+    => outerBest(REST, ALL, innerBest(ITEM1, ALL, P))
+endmodule

codex
The outer proof is still running without emitting a residual; that is expectedly heavier because it composes a symbolic inner scan at each outer step. I’m letting it finish within the 8 GB constraint rather than changing the theory without evidence.
