The process is CPU-active but is clearly expanding the inner loop instead of applying its invariant. The cause is the focused `--claims SPEC.outer-loop` filter, which removes the inner claim from the active circularity set. I’m stopping that diagnostic run and will prove inner plus outer together so composition is available.
